v2/backend/app/cli/paper_online_runtime.py:1379:The V2 paper runtime is online as a continuous, non-live paper chain. It observes read-only market data, builds a V2 paper-only trainer wrapper prediction, emits current signal lineage, sends the signal through the Risk Gateway, records a paper ledger event, and writes only local V2 runtime payloads. It does not place exchange orders and live remains blocked_human_only.
